exports[`asPartitionFaultSection given: [case6] a malfunction of the review itself (a buffer overrun) when: [t0] the section renders then: it matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# blocker.1 — this partition did not review

💥 MalfunctionError: the partition failed before it returned a verdict: spawnSync /bin/sh ENOBUFS

an unread verdict cannot be assumed clean, so it counts as one blocker.
every other partition kept its verdict above and below. this fault is a malfunction of
the review itself, not a transient one, so a re-arrive alone will not fix it.
fix: repair what raised \`spawnSync /bin/sh ENOBUFS\`, then re-arrive."
`;

